                  "text": "`OPTIONS & VOL · REPORTED`\n\n**Why is gamma largest at the money near expiry?**"
                }
              }
            ],
            "back": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "props": {
                  "text": "Delta must travel from about $0$ to about $1$ across the strike; less time compresses that transition into a narrower spot band, so its slope, gamma, spikes at $K$."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
